  "generate.topicMapping.tips.downlink.multiMappingConfig": "**Config:**\n```\nMapping 1: devices/command/&#123;device_number&#125;/+ → wled/&#123;device_number&#125;/cmd (data_identifier = \"wled\")\nMapping 2: devices/command/&#123;device_number&#125;/+ → default/&#123;device_number&#125;/cmd (data_identifier = \"default\")\n```",
  "generate.topicMapping.tips.downlink.multiMappingProcess": "**Message processing:**\n- Web sends: `&#123;\"method\": \"wled\", \"params\": &#123;\"delay\": 3&#125;&#125;`\n- System matches `method=\"wled\"` → Mapping 1\n- Device receives: `&#123;\"delay\": 3&#125;` to `wled/&#123;device_number&#125;/cmd`",
